Replaces the placeholder ladder in quote-pricing.ts with the canonical
2026-05-06 office sheet:

  8x8   $1,000
  10x10 $1,900
  12x12 $1,800
  14x14 $2,200
  16x16 $2,600

RollupSize type updated (9x8 and 16x14 dropped — not on the canonical
sheet — and 8x8 + 16x16 added). CalculatorStep.tsx ROLLUP_SIZES array
updated to match.

Anomaly preserved as-written: 10x10 ($1,900) sits above 12x12 ($1,800)
on the sheet; flagged inline + in Decisions.md for the next price-sheet
pass.
