 Decisions.md                                  |  1 +
 .../quotes/new/_components/CalculatorStep.tsx |  2 +-
 src/lib/quote-pricing.ts                      | 20 +++++++++++--------
 3 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

